<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="ko"><head><jsp:include page="../common/head.jsp"/></head>
<body data-page="prediction-history"><jsp:include page="../common/sidebar.jsp"/><div class="app-shell"><jsp:include page="../common/header.jsp"/><main>
<div class="page-title"><div><h1>예측 이력</h1><p>저장된 과거 분석 결과와 모델 버전을 확인합니다.</p></div></div>
<form id="historyForm" class="filter-panel"><div class="customer-search-with-bulk"><label>고객 검색<input id="customerId" placeholder="고객번호를 입력하세요."></label><button id="predictionHistoryBulkSearchTrigger" class="bulk-search-trigger" type="button">+ 다량 입력</button></div><div class="base-month-picker"><label>기준년<select id="baseYearSelect" data-base-year></select></label><label>기준월<select id="baseMonthSelect" data-base-month></select></label><select id="baseYmSelect" hidden aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><option value="">전체</option></select></div><label>위험등급<select id="riskGrade"><option value="">전체</option><option value="NORMAL">정상</option><option value="INTEREST">관심</option><option value="CAUTION">주의</option><option value="WARNING">경고</option></select></label><label>LLM 상태<select id="llmStatus"><option value="">전체</option><option value="COMPLETED">완료</option><option value="FAILED">실패</option><option value="SKIPPED_NO_EVIDENCE">근거 없음</option><option value="NOT_REQUESTED">미요청</option></select></label><button class="primary" type="submit">검색</button></form>
<section class="panel"><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>분석일시</th><th>고객번호</th><th>고객명</th><th>기준월</th><th>1개월</th><th>2개월</th><th>3개월</th><th>등급</th><th>모델</th><th>LLM</th></tr></thead><tbody id="historyTable"></tbody></table></div></section><p id="pageError" class="error-message" hidden></p>
</main></div><jsp:include page="../common/bulk-customer-search-modal.jsp"/><script src="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/js/api.js?v=20260906-1"></script><script src="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/js/bulk-customer-search.js?v=20260907-1"></script><script src="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/js/prediction-history.js?v=20260907-1"></script></body></html>
